    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u300a \u00a0 &quot;You neither possess soul nor heart to walk amongst the Home colony with your head held high.</i>&quot;\u00a0 \u300b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Story:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been exiled from society. The Magistrate has sent you to a\u00a0remote outpost far from the Home colony. Your only chance for redemption is to successfully locate a radar signal\u00a0deep in the canyons nearby. Can you find it before you lose all favor in the eyes of the Home colony?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619\u00a0 \u00a0 Experience a strange and mysterious story in this visual novel with light point-and-click elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619 \u00a0\u00a0 Explore the outpost and get to know your co-workers, Noyes and Twisse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619\u00a0 \u00a0 An original soundtrack full of suspense, thrills, and atmospheric ambience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619 \u00a0\u00a0 Approximately 30 to 40 minutes playtime with two different not-quite-endings.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u300a \u00a0 &quot;You neither possess soul nor heart to walk amongst the Home colony with your head held high.</i>&quot;\u00a0 \u300b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Story:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been exiled from society. The Magistrate has sent you to a\u00a0remote outpost far from the Home colony. Your only chance for redemption is to successfully locate a radar signal\u00a0deep in the canyons nearby. Can you find it before you lose all favor in the eyes of the Home colony?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619\u00a0 \u00a0 Experience a strange and mysterious story in this visual novel with light point-and-click elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619 \u00a0\u00a0 Explore the outpost and get to know your co-workers, Noyes and Twisse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619\u00a0 \u00a0 An original soundtrack full of suspense, thrills, and atmospheric ambience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619 \u00a0\u00a0 Approximately 30 to 40 minutes playtime with two different not-quite-endings.</p>",
